<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>For us He was crucified,</l><l>Hallelujah!</l><l>For the many, one Man died,</l><l>Glory to God!</l><l>One grain fell into the earth,</l><l>Many grains to bring to birth.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>He arose in victory,</l><l>Hallelujah!</l><l>From the grave, triumphantly,</l><l>Glory to God!</l><l>Now in resurrection He</l><l>As the Spirit lives in me.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
